This directory contains the supporting codebase that
supports both v1 and v2 protocol in connection.

To use it set the following environtment variable:
`$export ADA_BOTH_PROTOCOLS="True"`

and generate code for both protocols like:
`$python3 -m pymavlink.tools.mavgen --lang=Ada --wire-protocol=1.0 --output={output_dir} mavlink/message_definitions/v1.0/common.xml`

`$python3 -m pymavlink.tools.mavgen --lang=Ada --wire-protocol=2.0 --output={output_dir} mavlink/message_definitions/v1.0/common.xml`